Herdr agent-detection manifests
===============================

The files in this directory are unmodified copies of agent-detection
manifests from Herdr.

Project:    Herdr
Repository: https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr
Ref:        preview-2026-08-31-b1ff4582e968
Commit:     b1ff4582e9688f52ffb943cfa8bee4871ae122e4
Catalog:    https://herdr.dev/agent-detection/index.toml
License:    Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory)

These files are copied verbatim. Sidecar does not modify them; local rule
changes live in ../sidecar/<agent>.toml as overlays, and
TestVendoredManifestsMatchLock fails if a byte here changes without a
matching entry in ../upstream.lock.json.

